MACRO P                                                                         
  &P.ARB-WARBAREA                                         W    31 A             
*                                 PARAMETRAR TILL WARBKONV F÷R                  
*                                 BERƒKNING AV ARBETSDAGAR.                     
*                                 EXEMPEL P≈ ANROP:                             
*                                 BERƒKNA ANTAL ARB.DAGAR MELLAN                
*                                 TIAAMMDD-FOM OCH -TOM  INKL.                  
*                                 SEMESTER OCH HALVDAGAR:                       
*                                 MOVE 101 TO ARB-KDCALL.                       
*                                 CALL WARBKONV USING                           
*                                      ARB-KDCALL,                              
*                                      ARB-DATUM-AREA,                          
*                                      ARB-KDSVAR                               
*                                 RESULTAT ERH≈LLS I                            
*                                 ARB-DATUM-AREA.                               
*                                 STATUSKOD I ARB-KDSVAR.                       
*                                 -------------------------------               
*                                 PARAMETERS TO WARBKONV FOR                    
*                                 COMPUTATION OF WORKING DAYS.                  
*                                 EXAMPLE OF CALL::                             
*                                 COMPUTE NBR OF WORKING DAYS                   
*                                 BETWEEN TIAAMMDD-FOM AND -TOM                 
*                                 INCLUDING PARTS DIV. SUMMER                   
*                                 VACATION AND "HALF DAYS".                     
*                                 MOVE 101 TO ARB-KDCALL.                       
*                                 CALL WARBKONV USING                           
*                                      ARB-KDCALL,                              
*                                      ARB-DATUM-AREA,                          
*                                      ARB-KDSVAR                               
*                                 RESULTAT IS PLACED IN                         
*                                 ARB-DATUM-AREA.                               
*                                 RETURN CODE IN ARB-KDSVAR                     
*                                 -------------------------------               
    &P.ARB-KDCALL                        &P.ARB-WARBAREA        3 N             
*                                 BEARBETNINGSTYP I WARBKONV:                   
*                                 OM KDCALL > 500 ANVƒNDS                       
*                                 LAGRETS LEDIGA DAGAR                          
*                                 HUNDRATALS-SIFFRAN:                           
*                                  0=  SEMESTERDAG = ARBETSDAG                  
*                                  1=  KONTORSEMESTER = LEDIG DAG               
*                                  5=  SEMESTERDAG = ARBETSDAG                  
*                                  6=  LAGER-SEMESTER = LEDIG DAG               
*                                 TIOTALS-SIFFRAN:                              
*                                  0=  HALVDAG = ARBETSDAG                      
*                                  1=  HALVDAG = LEDIG DAG                      
*                                  2=  1 HALVDAG  = 0 ARBETSDAGAR               
*                                      2 HALVDAGAR= 1 ARBETSDAG                 
*                                      3 HALVDAGAR= 1 ARBETSDAG                 
*                                      4 HALVDAGAR= 2 ARBETSDAGAR               
*                                      OSV                                      
*                                 ENTALS-SIFFRAN:                               
*                                  1=  BERƒKNA ARBDAG = TOM MINUS               
*                                      FOM     (1 DAG OM TOM=FOM)               
*                                  2=  BERƒKNA TOM = FOM + ARBDAG               
*                                          (1 ARBDAG GER TOM=FOM)               
*                                  3=  BERƒKNA FOM = TOM MINUS                  
*                                      ARBDAG (1 DAG GER FOM=TOM)               
*                                  4=  ARBETSTIMMAR PER DAG                     
*                                      OM FOM ƒR FRIDAG  GES 0                  
*                                      OM FOM ƒR HALVDAG GES 5                  
*                                      OM FOM ƒR HELDAG  GES 8                  
*                                                                               
*                                  DE FƒLT SOM BEH÷VS F÷R BE-                   
*                                  RƒKNINGEN SKA FYLLAS I F÷RE                  
*                                  ANROPET.                                     
*                                 TYPE OF COMPUTATION IN WARBKONV               
*                                 IF KDCALL > 500 THE WAREHOUSE                 
*                                 FREE DAYS WILL BE USED                        
*                                 FIRST (100) DIGIT                             
*                                  0=  SUMMER VACATION = WORK DAY               
*                                  1=  OFFICE VICATION = FREE DAY               
*                                  5=  SUMMER VACATION = WORK DAY               
*                                  6=  WAREHOUSE VICATION = FREE                
*                                 SECOND (010) DIGIT:                           
*                                  0=  HALF DAY = WORKING DAY                   
*                                  1=  HALF DAY = FREE DAY                      
*                                  2=  1 HALF DAY = 0 WORK DAYS                 
*                                      2 HALF DAYS = 1 WORK DAY                 
*                                      3 HALF DAYS = 1 WORK DAY                 
*                                      4 HALF DAYS = 2 WORK DAYS                
*                                      ETC                                      
*                                 THIRD (001) DIGIT:                            
*                                  1=  COMPUTE ARBDAG = TOM MINUS               
*                                      FOM   (1 DAY IF FOM = TOM)               
*                                  2=  COMPUTE TOM = FOM + ARBDAG               
*                                      (1 ARBDAG MAKES TOM = FOM)               
*                                  3=  COMPUTE FOM =                            
*                                                TOM MINUS ARBDAG               
*                                      (1 ARBDAG MAKES TOM = FOM)               
*                                  4=  WORKING HOURS PER DAY                    
*                                      IF FOM = FREE DAY ==> 0                  
*                                      IF FOM = HALF DAY ==> 5                  
*                                      IF FOM = WORK DAY ==> 8                  
*                                                                               
*                                  THE FIELDS NEEDED FOR THE                    
*                                  COMPUTATION MUST BE ASSIGNED                 
*                                  BEFORE THE CALL.                             
*                                                                               
    &P.ARB-DATUM-AREA                    &P.ARB-WARBAREA +3    27 A             
      &P.ARB-TIAAMMDD-FOM                &P.ARB-WARBAREA +3     6 N             
*                                 ≈R - M≈NAD - DAG  (≈≈MMDD)                    
*                                 YEAR - MONTH - DAY  (YYMMDD)                  
      &P.ARB-TIAAMMDD-TOM                 &P.ARB-WARBAREA +9    6 N             
*                                 ≈R - M≈NAD - DAG  (≈≈MMDD)                    
*                                 YEAR - MONTH - DAY  (YYMMDD)                  
      &P.ARB-KVARBDAG                     &P.ARB-WARBAREA +15   3 N             
*                                 ANTAL ARBETSDAGAR                             
*                                 NUMBER OF WORKING DAYS                        
      &P.ARB-KVARBTIM                     &P.ARB-WARBAREA +15   3 N             
*                                 ANTAL ARBETSTIMMAR                            
*                                 NUMBER OF WORKING HOURS                       
      &P.ARB-TIAAMMDD-NAESTA-ARBDAG       &P.ARB-WARBAREA +18   6 N             
*                                 ≈R - M≈NAD - DAG  (≈≈MMDD)                    
*                                 YEAR - MONTH - DAY  (YYMMDD)                  
      &P.ARB-TIAAMMDD-NAESTA-VECKA        &P.ARB-WARBAREA +24   6 N             
*                                 ≈R - M≈NAD - DAG  (≈≈MMDD)                    
*                                 YEAR - MONTH - DAY  (YYMMDD)                  
    &P.ARB-KDSVAR                         &P.ARB-WARBAREA +30   1 A             
*     88 ARB-KDSVAR-OK       VALUE ' '.                                         
*     88 ARB-KDSVAR-FEL      VALUE 'F'.                                         
*                                                       KDSVAR-88               
*                                 SVARSKOD FR≈N SUBPROGRAM                      
*                                                       KDSVAR-88               
*                                 RETURN CODE FROM SUBPROGRAM                   
*** END COPY  WARBAREA               LENGTH =            31                     
